        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium chloride, brine solution, at plant
na;
CAS number: 007647-14-5; 
Formula: NaCl; 
Synonyms: Salzlösung, salt solution; 
UUID: 91575c0a-b200-3b07-93d7-8f6a0d9b4e37
this module includes the solution mining process of sodium chloride for the preparation of a brine for industrial use. No cleaning or drying step are therefore included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: modern solution mining technique (mix)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_91575c0a-b200-3b07-93d7-8f6a0d9b4e37.xml</text>
